%% State is scoped by Pod version / horizon / universe; implementation is separate.
flowchart LR
  Development[DEVELOPMENT] --> Backtest[BACKTESTING]
  Backtest --> Shadow[PAPER_SHADOW]
  Shadow --> Review[Owner-approved evidence policy / human review]
  Review --> Qualified[QUALIFIED]
  Qualified --> Activation[Explicit activation]
  Activation --> Active[ACTIVE_PAPER]
  Active --> Suspended[SUSPENDED]
  Qualified --> Suspended
  Shadow --> Suspended
  Suspended --> Resume[Reviewed resume / requalify affected scope]
  Resume --> Backtest
  Suspended --> Monitor[Preserve held lots / healthy authorized reducing exits]
  Resume -->|Evidence still valid and explicit review| Qualified
